WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:08.219
Speaker 1: OK, something completely predictable
is happening with so-called vaccine passports,

00:00:08.219 --> 00:00:11.019
so-called mandatory vaccines.

00:00:11.019 --> 00:00:13.610
And this we predicted it weeks ago.

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:15.600
It didn't require any special insights.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.470
I didn't need a crystal ball.

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:21.650
I'm not some kind of soothsayer for realizing
this was going to happen.

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:29.779
On the one hand, we expected there would be
schools, businesses, employers, airlines,

00:00:29.779 --> 00:00:33.750
whatever that would start to say after a certain
date.

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:38.550
If you want to do business with us, if you
want to go to school here, et cetera, you

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:41.100
will need to be vaccinated against covid-19.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.120
Now, that was our prediction at the time.

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:45.000
It hadn't yet started to happen.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.730
We also we're seeing some states Arizona was
one that we mentioned at the time, but now

00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:57.230
there are more that we're decreasing bans
against mandatory vaccination or so-called

00:00:57.230 --> 00:00:58.230
vaccine passport.

00:00:58.230 --> 00:01:03.040
So, for example, we covered last week or the
week before that Arizona Governor Doug Ducey

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:06.290
defiantly said we will not have any vaccine.

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:08.350
Passports here are mandatory vaccine requirements.

00:01:08.350 --> 00:01:13.410
But of course, it only applies to state government
and to municipalities.

00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:18.220
Tucson can't require every Tucson resident
get vaccinated, but of course, that was never

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:19.490
going to happen.

00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:25.260
However, we are seeing more and more some
employers, but many, many schools.

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:30.220
We now have more than one hundred U.S. colleges
and universities that are saying to come back

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:34.150
to campus in the fall you need to be vaccinated
against coronavirus.

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:37.000
There's nothing legally complicated about
it.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:41.210
Before the pandemic, when I went to college,
I had to show proof of certain vaccinations.

00:01:41.210 --> 00:01:46.850
I don't remember exactly hepatitis and I needed,
you know, a tetanus shot booster, whatever.

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:47.850
There's been a list.

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:52.140
This has been going on for a very long time
and exactly what we predicted is happening.

00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:57.150
And what is that that people in some of these
states, because now you have in addition to

00:01:57.150 --> 00:02:03.310
Arizona, you have the Arkansas governor signing
into law of measures preventing governments

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:04.820
from requiring vaccination.

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:07.830
But this is not about governments requiring
it.

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:11.920
Texas, South Dakota, Idaho, you know, all
these Florida, all these different states

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:17.860
are signing different things, banning required
vaccination, but it only applies to government

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:21.300
and some very narrow other situations.

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:24.780
So you are starting to see the posts are all
over the Internet.

00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:25.890
They're all over my Twitter.

00:02:25.890 --> 00:02:28.080
Every time I tweet about vaccines, they're
all in the comments.

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:33.330
Every time you read about, oh, this university
will require vaccination, that one will for

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:37.099
on campus students, people commenting and
saying this is illegal.

00:02:37.099 --> 00:02:40.709
The governor already banned it.

00:02:40.709 --> 00:02:43.080
This was written on the wall.

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:48.459
Go back to my commentary from when we talked
about Arizona issuing a ban on vaccine requirements

00:02:48.459 --> 00:02:54.020
and I said you were going to have these anti
VAX people showing up saying you can't do

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:55.740
this because the governor banned it.

00:02:55.740 --> 00:03:03.980
And, of course, the governor's orders do not
apply to colleges and universities and Ticketmaster

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:09.770
and Live Nation or if the Phenix Suns in Arizona,
they're the basketball team wants to say to

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:13.340
come to games, you have to have proof of vaccination.

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:17.130
Or they might say you need proof of vaccination
or you've got to take a negative test if you're

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:18.470
not vaccinated.

00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:19.910
These are two different things.

00:03:19.910 --> 00:03:25.330
And we knew that they were going to start
confusing them either deliberately or because

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:29.950
they don't actually understand the limits
of what government can and cannot decree here.

00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:32.319
One thing has nothing to do with the other.

00:03:32.319 --> 00:03:35.660
It was predictable that it would create chaos.

00:03:35.660 --> 00:03:39.160
And we're not even at the point where kids
are starting to go back to school yet by the

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:41.930
time that fall comes.

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:44.239
We hopefully will be closer to herd immunity.

00:03:44.239 --> 00:03:48.621
There are concerns as to whether we will ever
get there, but we will should be closer, if

00:03:48.621 --> 00:03:49.621
not actually there.

00:03:49.621 --> 00:03:54.150
I think we will be doing very well as far
as cases and deaths go by that point in time.

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:57.551
Everybody who wants a vaccine by far will
have been able to get one.

00:03:57.551 --> 00:03:58.700
We're getting close to that.

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:04.290
And now it's about convincing people to want
to get the vaccine way more colleges and universities

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:09.810
and maybe airlines and maybe other venues
and businesses and on and on hospitals, whatever

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:15.240
will have said in order to work here, in order
to attend school here, in order to patronize

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:19.380
our services that we offer, you will need
to have proof of vaccination and they are

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:21.430
going to be going absolutely nuts.

00:04:21.430 --> 00:04:22.539
How does this get solved?

00:04:22.539 --> 00:04:24.120
I have no idea.

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:26.900
I have no idea the the level of misunderstanding.

00:04:26.900 --> 00:04:28.889
And it's predictable.

00:04:28.889 --> 00:04:33.889
Listen, it's true that even people who aren't
particularly ignorant, if you don't follow

00:04:33.889 --> 00:04:40.069
this stuff closely and you hear, you know,
Arizona, Arizona governor bans mandatory vaccines.

00:04:40.069 --> 00:04:44.919
And meanwhile, Arizona State University says
you've got to be vaccinated to come to campus.

00:04:44.919 --> 00:04:47.699
That does sound like a conflict in some sense.

00:04:47.699 --> 00:04:53.999
And it requires understanding that what the
Arizona governor passed applies only to a

00:04:53.999 --> 00:04:59.991
city, can't require being vaccinated to go
to the DMV or deny you DMV services, that

00:04:59.991 --> 00:05:00.991
type of thing.

00:05:00.991 --> 00:05:05.699
It does not apply to Arizona, Arizona State
University or whatever else.

00:05:05.699 --> 00:05:07.229
It was completely predictable.

00:05:07.229 --> 00:05:08.710
It's going to be absolute chaos.

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:13.930
And I think there is going to be probably
as travel starts to open in other countries,

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:18.240
there are already other countries that are
leaning in the direction of saying if American

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:22.089
travelers, if any travelers want to come here,
you will need to be vaccinated.

00:05:22.089 --> 00:05:25.169
This is likely to reach a fever pitch in July
into August.

00:05:25.169 --> 00:05:28.810
And as we get close to the fall semester,
there's going to be protests.

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:30.620
There's going to be absolute and total chaos.

00:05:30.620 --> 00:07:06.900
And it was completely predictable all along.

